  "description": "Please note: Batteries are NOT included with this kit. The Voopoo Drag X2 pod vape kit is a stylish, lightweight and user-friendly device that offers raw power with astonishing versatility. Powered by a single 18650 battery (sold separately) , it delivers an impressive 5-80W power output . This makes it a suitable choice for a variety of vaping styles, from Mouth To Lung (MTL) to Restricted Direct To Lung (RDTL) and Direct To Lung (DTL) . In the kit, you'll find the PnP X Cartridge and two PnP X coils, ensuring you can start vaping immediately. The Drag X2 is equipped with Voopoo’s advanced Gene.TT 2.0 chipset and offers three distinct modes: Smart, Eco, and RBA . Smart Mode intelligently recognizes the coil you’re using and optimizes power output for a hassle-free experience. Eco Mode conserves battery life for prolonged vaping sessions, while RBA Mode gives more experienced vapers precise control over wattage. Refilling the PnP X DTL 2ml pod is straightforward, thanks to its accessible side-filling design. Compatible with all of Voopoo’s outstanding PnP X coils, the pod caters to MTL, RDTL, and DTL preferences. The kit includes a 0.15 Ohm coil for a DTL inhale, optimal between 60-80W with high-VG e-liquids , and a 0.3 Ohm coil for an adjustable MTL or RDTL experience, best between 32-40W with 50% VG juice. The Drag X2 distinguishes itself with its ergonomic design, portability and full-featured functionality, making it an excellent choice for vapers seeking a customizable and powerful vaping experience. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
